console.log('exported functions:', fns.join(', '));
console.log('missing README sections:', missing.join(', ') || 'none');
process.exit(missing.length ? 1 : 0);
"
It must print `missing README sections: none` and exit 0.
6. Commit the changes to index.js, README.md and test/strutil.test.js and open the pull request referencing issue #7.

